  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v6185uXuapIUIXCZUMIRZIU\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v6185uXuapIUIXCZUMIRZIU?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY2MTg1dVh1YXBJVUlYQ1pVTUlSWklVIiwidGlkIjoiMzBjMDA2NzQtOGM1MC00ZGU2LWExYmUtOGIwN2ZlYThiMThmIiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg2MzIzfQ.KVJRArKcdcP_u2RYHgJIpyR9TeW8QAJxfmqnEQft41zFtE2_2ipdNL5U5gKHxzRpGx6oKpVO8UuUAv65CaY67Q&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
